-- exp-x-times-bracket  (band 2, single_choice)
values ((select id from topics where slug = 'expanding-and-factorising'), 'Expand x(x + 3).', 'Multiply both terms inside by x: x × x = x² and x × 3 = 3x, so x(x + 3) = x² + 3x. Multiplying only the first term gives x² + 3. Writing x + 3x treats x × x as x. 2x + 3 adds the x to itself instead of multiplying by x.', 2, 'PUBLISHED', 'SEED', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', 7);
